+# Record task createdAt and updatedAt
+
+Request: record when each task was created and when it was last changed.
+
+- Every task has `createdAt` and `updatedAt`, ISO-8601 date-time strings; on `add` they are equal.
+- Completing, reopening, renaming, tagging and untagging set `updatedAt` to the time of the change.
+- The domain does not read the clock: the list takes a clock function, and `createTodoList` supplies the real one.
